    <briefdescription>
<para>Adjust PSA configuration: automatic enablement from legacy. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>To simplify some edge cases, we automatically enable certain cryptographic mechanisms in the PSA API if they are enabled in the legacy API. The general idea is that if legacy module M uses mechanism A internally, and A has both a legacy and a PSA implementation, we enable A through PSA whenever it&apos;s enabled through legacy. This facilitates the transition to PSA implementations of A for users of M. </para>    </detaileddescription>
